//
// asReal itself does not allocate memory (Invariant 2 not triggered).
// It reads from the data buffer of an existing SEXP whose memory is owned
// by the Python caller.
//
// However, every .Call entry-point that calls asReal (rpartexp2, xpred)
// also calls ALLOC / R_alloc for scratch arrays in the same function body.
// Once fake_arena.h is available, declare `ArenaFrame _frame;` as the
